      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TALLINGAS AVANTI (8) excellent debut when supported late in betting to finish a close up third over 1000m at Wangaratta. Promising type who gets weight relief today from the right draw. Ready to get off the mark. KAPOLEI (5) showed good early speed first up for the new yard before tiring in the straight when sixth over 1100m at Nowra. Fitter now in a more appropriate race. Stays in the mix. NOT GUILTY (1) resumes after he struggled on the Ballarat Synthetic track at his last two outings. Assess on his good debut third over the 1100m at Werribee. Each way player. DROVERS DEN (9) is a three-year-old Denman filly from Kuraver on debut from the Gary Colvin yard. Finished third in her only trial over 1000m at Wagga on the heavy surface. Keep safe. FIGHTING FOX (4) resumes. Caught the eye at her second race start when third over 1000m at Wagga Wagga in a Super Maiden. Drawn out and look for her late.",
